# <type>: <short summary, imperative, 50 chars or less>
#
# <detailed description — why, not just what>
# - Change 1
# - Change 2
#
# Refs #<issue-number>        (use on commits; Closes #<N> goes in the PR body only)
#
# Types:
#   feat     new feature
#   fix      bug fix
#   docs     documentation only
#   config   configuration change
#   security security-related change
#
# Rules:
# - Subject line: imperative mood, no trailing period, <=50 chars
# - Atomic: one logical change per commit; if you can't describe it in one
#   sentence, split it
# - Body wraps at 72 chars, explains why not what